"can pass them into the :meth:`~django.views.generic.base.View.as_view` "
"method call itself::"
msgstr ""
"Is é an bealach is díreach chun tuairimí cineálacha a úsáid ná iad a chruthú "
"go díreach i do URLConf. Mura bhfuil tú ag athrú ach cúpla tréith ar radharc "
"rang-bhunaithe, is féidir leat iad a chur isteach sa mhodh:meth: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Base.View.as_View` glaoch air féin::"

msgid ""
"Any arguments passed to :meth:`~django.views.generic.base.View.as_view` will "
"override attributes set on the class. In this example, we set "
"``template_name`` on the ``TemplateView``. A similar overriding pattern can "
"be used for the ``url`` attribute "
"on :class:`~django.views.generic.base.RedirectView`."
