"agus JSON a thabhairt ar ais, ag brath ar roinnt maoin den iarratas HTTP, "
"mar argóint fiosrúcháin nó ceannteideal HTTP. Measc sna "
"``JSONResponseMixin`` agus a:class: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Detail.SingleObjectTemplateResponseMixin` araon, agus "
"déan cur i bhfeidhmiú:func: "
"`~Django.Views.Generic.Base.TemplateResponseMixin.Render_to_Response () `a "
