msgstr ""
"Cé go bhfuil an chuid is mó de na modhanna ón gcaighdeán ``QuerySet` "
"inrochtana go díreach ón ``Bainiste``, is amhlaidh amháin maidir leis na "
"modhanna breise atá sainmhínithe ar ``QuerySet`` saincheaptha má chuireann "
"tú i bhfeidhm iad ar an ``Bainiste`` freisin:"

msgid ""
"This example allows you to call both ``authors()`` and ``editors()`` "
"directly from the manager ``Person.people``."
msgstr ""
"Ligeann an sampla seo duit glaoch ar ``údair () ``agus `eagarthóirí ()`` "
"araon ón mbainisteoir ``Person.People``."

msgid "Creating a manager with ``QuerySet`` methods"
msgstr "Bainisteoir a chruthú le modhanna ``QuerySet`"

msgid ""
"In lieu of the above approach which requires duplicating methods on both the "
"``QuerySet`` and the ``Manager``, :meth:`QuerySet.as_manager() "
