msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.as_manager>In ionad an chur chuige thuas a "
"éilíonn modhanna dúbailte ar an ``QuerySet`` agus an `Bainiste`` araon, is "
"féidir :meth: `QuerySet.as_Manager () `a úsáid chun sampla de `Bainisteoir "
"``a chruthú le cóip de mhodhanna saincheaptha ``QuerySet``:"

msgid ""
"The ``Manager`` instance created by :meth:`QuerySet.as_manager() "
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.as_manager>` will be virtually identical to "
"the ``PersonManager`` from the previous example."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.as_manager>Beidh an t-áis ``Bainiste`` a "
"chruthaí:meth: `QuerySet.as_Manager () `beagnach comhionann leis an "
"``PersonManager`` ón sampla roimhe seo."

msgid ""
"Not every ``QuerySet`` method makes sense at the ``Manager`` level; for "
"instance we intentionally prevent the :meth:`QuerySet.delete() "
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.delete>` method from being copied onto the "
"``Manager`` class."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.query.QuerySet.delete>Ní bhíonn ciall ar gach modh "
"``QuerySet` ag leibhéal ``Bainiste``; mar shampla cuirimid cosc d'aon ghnó "
"an modh:meth: `QuerySet.delete () `ó chóipeáil chuig an rang ``Bainiste``."

msgid "Methods are copied according to the following rules:"
msgstr "Déantar modhanna a chóipeáil de réir na rialacha seo a leanas:"

msgid "Public methods are copied by default."
msgstr "Cóipeáltar modhanna poiblí de réir réamhshoc"

msgid ""
"Private methods (starting with an underscore) are not copied by default."
msgstr ""
"Ní chóipeáiltear modhanna príobháideacha (ag tosú le béim) de réir "
"réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Methods with a ``queryset_only`` attribute set to ``False`` are always "
"copied."
msgstr ""
"Déantar modhanna a bhfuil tréith ``queryset_only`` socraithe go ``False`` "
"cóipeáil i gcónaí."

msgid ""
"Methods with a ``queryset_only`` attribute set to ``True`` are never copied."
msgstr ""
"Ní chóipeáiltear modhanna le tréith ``queryset_only`` atá socraithe go "
"``True`` riamh."

msgid "``from_queryset()``"
msgstr "```from_queryset () ``"

msgid ""
"For advanced usage you might want both a custom ``Manager`` and a custom "
"``QuerySet``. You can do that by calling ``Manager.from_queryset()`` which "
