"``QuerySet`` methods::"
msgstr ""
"Le haghaidh ardúsáide b'fhéidir gur mhaith leat ``Bainiste`` saincheaptha "
"agus ``QuerySet` saincheaptha araon. Is féidir leat é sin a dhéanamh trí "
"ghlaoch ar `Manager.from_querySet () ``a thugann seach*fo-aicme* de do bhonn "
"``Bainiste`` le cóip de na modhanna saincheaptha ``QuerySet``:"

msgid "You may also store the generated class into a variable::"
msgstr "Féadfaidh tú an rang a ghintear a stóráil in athróg freisin:"

msgid "Custom managers and model inheritance"
msgstr "Bainisteoirí saincheaptha agus oidhreacht samhail"

msgid ""
"Here's how Django handles custom managers and :ref:`model inheritance <model-"
"inheritance>`:"
msgstr ""
"<model-inheritance>Seo mar a láimhseálann Django bainisteoirí saincheaptha "
"agus:ref: `oidhreacht mhúnla `:"

msgid ""
"Managers from base classes are always inherited by the child class, using "
"Python's normal name resolution order (names on the child class override all "
"others; then come names on the first parent class, and so on)."
msgstr ""
"Déanann an rang leanaí oidhreacht bainisteoirí ó ranganna bonn i gcónaí, ag "
"baint úsáide as gnáthordú réitigh ainmneacha Python (athraíonn ainmneacha ar "
"an rang linbh gach duine eile; ansin tagann ainmneacha ar an gcéad rang "
"tuismitheora, agus mar sin de)."

msgid ""
"If no managers are declared on a model and/or its parents, Django "
"automatically creates the ``objects`` manager."
msgstr ""
"Mura dhearbhaítear aon bhainisteoirí ar mhúnla agus/nó a thuismitheoirí, "
"cruthaíonn Django an bainisteoir ``rudaí ``go huathoibríoch."

msgid ""
"The default manager on a class is either the one chosen "
"with :attr:`Meta.default_manager_name "
"<django.db.models.Options.default_manager_name>`, or the first manager "
"declared on the model, or the default manager of the first parent model."
msgstr ""
"Is é an bainisteoir réamhshocraithe ar rang an ceann a roghnaíodh le:attr: "
"`meta.default_manager_name <django.db.models.Options.default_manager_name>`, "
"nó an chéad bhainisteoir a dhearbhaigh ar an tsamhail, nó bainisteoir "
"réamhshocraithe an chéad mhúmhúnla tuismitheora."

msgid ""
"These rules provide the necessary flexibility if you want to install a "
"collection of custom managers on a group of models, via an abstract base "
"class, but still customize the default manager. For example, suppose you "
"have this base class::"
msgstr ""
"Soláthraíonn na rialacha seo an tsolúbthacht riachtanach más mian leat "
"bailiúchán bainisteoirí saincheaptha a shuiteáil ar ghrúpa samhlacha, trí "
"rang bonn teibí, ach an bainisteoir réamhshocraithe a shaincheapadh fós. Mar "
"shampla, cuir leis go bhfuil an bunaicme seo agat:"

msgid ""
"If you use this directly in a child class, ``objects`` will be the default "
"manager if you declare no managers in the child class::"
msgstr ""
"Má úsáideann tú é seo go díreach i rang leanaí, is é ``rudaí ``an "
"bainisteoir réamhshocraithe mura ndearbhaíonn tú aon bhainisteoirí sa rang "
"linbh:"

msgid ""
"If you want to inherit from ``AbstractBase``, but provide a different "
"default manager, you can provide the default manager on the child class::"
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat oidhreacht a dhéanamh ó `AbstractBase ``, ach bainisteoir "
"réamhshocraithe difriúil a sholáthar, is féidir leat an bainisteoir "
"réamhshocraithe a sholáthar ar rang an linbh:"

msgid ""
"Here, ``default_manager`` is the default. The ``objects`` manager is still "
"available, since it's inherited, but isn't used as the default."
msgstr ""
"Anseo, is é ``default_manager`` an réamhshocraithe. Tá an bainisteoir "
"``ruda`` ar fáil fós, ós rud é go bhfuil sé oidhreachta, ach ní úsáidtear é "
"mar réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Finally for this example, suppose you want to add extra managers to the "
