"`tagairt rogha réimse samhail choiteann `."

msgid "Automatic primary key fields"
msgstr "Príomhréimsí uathoibríoch"

msgid ""
"By default, Django gives each model an auto-incrementing primary key with "
"the type specified per app in :attr:`AppConfig.default_auto_field "
