"gcineál a shonraítear in aghaidh an aip in:attr: "
"`appconfig.default_AUTO_FIELD` nó ar fud an domhain sa socrú:: "
"`DEFAULT_AUTO_FIELD`. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"If you'd like to specify a custom primary key, "
"specify :attr:`primary_key=True <Field.primary_key>` on one of your fields. "
"If Django sees you've explicitly set :attr:`Field.primary_key`, it won't add "
"the automatic ``id`` column."
msgstr ""
"<Field.primary_key>Más mian leat eochair phríomhúil saincheaptha a shonrú, "
"sonraigh: attr: `primary_key=True `ar cheann de do réimsí. Má fheiceann "
"Django go bhfuil tú socraithe go sainráite: attr: `Field.primary_key`, ní "
"chuirfidh sé an colún `id`` uathoibríoch leis."

msgid ""
"Each model requires exactly one field to have :attr:`primary_key=True "
