msgid ""
":class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey`, :class:`~django.db.models.ManyToManyField` "
"and :class:`~django.db.models.OneToOneField` require the first argument to "
"be a model class, so use the :attr:`~Field.verbose_name` keyword argument::"
msgstr ""
":class: `~django.db.models.foreignKey`, :class: "
"`~django.db.models.manyToManyField` agus:class: "
"`~django.db.models.onetoonefield` éilíonn an chéad argóint ina rang samhail, "
"mar sin bain úsáid as argóint eochairfhocal::"

