"the :attr:`~Field.verbose_name`. Django will automatically capitalize the "
"first letter where it needs to."
msgstr ""
"Ní hé an coinbhinsiún chun an chéad litir den: attr: `~field.verbose_name` a "
"chaipitliú. Déanfaidh Django caipitliú go huathoibríoch an chéad litir nuair "
"is gá dó."

msgid "Relationships"
msgstr "Caidrimh"

msgid ""
