":class:`~django.db.models.ForeignKey` requires a positional argument: the "
"class to which the model is related."
msgstr ""
":class: `~Django.db.Models.ForeignKey` teastaíonn argóint seasmhach: an rang "
"lena mbaineann an tsamhail."

