"You can also create :ref:`recursive relationships <recursive-relationships>` "
"(an object with a many-to-one relationship to itself) "
"and :ref:`relationships to models not yet defined <lazy-relationships>`; "
"see :ref:`the model field reference <ref-foreignkey>` for details."
msgstr ""
"<ref-foreignkey>Is féidir leat freisin: ref: `caidrimh athshlánacha "
