msgid ""
"Hitting the database multiple times for different parts of a single 'set' of "
"data that you will need all parts of is, in general, less efficient than "
"retrieving it all in one query. This is particularly important if you have a "
"query that is executed in a loop, and could therefore end up doing many "
"database queries, when only one was needed. So:"
msgstr ""
"Go ginearálta, níl sé chomh héifeachtach an bunachar sonraí a bhualadh arís "
"agus arís eile do chodanna éagsúla de 'tacar' sonraí amháin a bheidh ag "
"teastáil uait gach cuid díobh ná iad go léir a aisghabháil in aon cheist "
"amháin. Tá sé seo tábhachtach go háirithe má tá ceist agat a "
"fhorghníomhaítear i lúb, agus dá bhrí sin d'fhéadfadh go leor ceisteanna "
"bunachar sonraí a dhéanamh, nuair nach raibh ach ceann amháin ag teastáil. "
"Mar sin:"

