"Since QuerySets are lazy, this does no database queries if "
"``display_group_members`` is ``False``."
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é go bhfuil QuerySets leisciúil, ní dhéanann sé seo aon cheisteanna "
"bunachar sonraí má tá ``display_group_members`` `False``."

