"úsáide as léiriú teaghrán na luachanna. Tá sé seo toisc nach soláthraíonn "
"MariaDB agus Bunachar Sonraí Oracle feidhm a athraíonn luachanna JSON ina "
"luachanna coibhéiseach SQL."

msgid "Oracle users"
msgstr "Úsáideoirí Oracle"

msgid ""
"On Oracle Database, using ``None`` as the lookup value in "
"an :meth:`~django.db.models.query.QuerySet.exclude` query will return "
"objects that do not have ``null`` as the value at the given path, including "
"objects that do not have the path. On other database backends, the query "
