msgid "Passing parameters into ``raw()``"
msgstr "Paraiméadair a chur isteach i ``raw () ``"

msgid ""
"If you need to perform parameterized queries, you can use the ``params`` "
"argument to ``raw()``:"
msgstr ""
"Más gá duit ceisteanna paraiméadair a dhéanamh, is féidir leat an argóint "
