msgstr ""
"Ní thacaítear le paramaí foclóra leis an gcúltaca SQLite; leis an gcúltaca "
"seo, ní mór duit paraiméadair a rith mar liosta."

msgid ""
"**Do not use string formatting on raw queries or quote placeholders in your "
