msgstr ""
"** Ná húsáid formáidiú teaghrán ar fhiosrúcháin amh nó luaigh sealbhóirí "
"áiteanna i do theagáin SQL! **"

msgid "It's tempting to write the above query as:"
msgstr "Tá sé mealltach an cheist thuas a scríobh mar:"

msgid ""
"You might also think you should write your query like this (with quotes "
