msgstr ""
"B'fhéidir go gceapfá freisin gur chóir duit do cheist a scríobh mar seo (le "
"luachana timpeall ``%s``):"

msgid "**Don't make either of these mistakes.**"
msgstr "** Ná déan ceachtar de na botúin seo. **"

msgid ""
"As discussed in :ref:`sql-injection-protection`, using the ``params`` "
"argument and leaving the placeholders unquoted protects you from `SQL "
"injection attacks`__, a common exploit where attackers inject arbitrary SQL "
"into your database. If you use string interpolation or quote the "
"placeholder, you're at risk for SQL injection."
msgstr ""
"Mar a pléadh in:ref: `sql-injection-protection`, ag baint úsáide as an "
"argóint `params`` agus na sealbhóirí áit a fhágáil gan luaite cosnaíonn tú ó "
"`ionsaithe insteallta SQL`__, saothrú coitianta ina ndéanann ionsaitheoirí "
"SQL treallach a instealladh isteach i do bhunachar sonraí. Má úsáideann tú "
"idirghabháil sreangáin nó má luann tú an sealbhóir iontu, tá tú i mbaol "
"instealladh SQL."

msgid "Executing custom SQL directly"
msgstr "SQL saincheaptha a fhorghníomhú"

msgid ""
"Sometimes even :meth:`Manager.raw` isn't quite enough: you might need to "
"perform queries that don't map cleanly to models, or directly execute "
