msgid ""
"Calls a database stored procedure with the given name. A sequence "
"(``params``) or dictionary (``kparams``) of input parameters may be "
"provided. Most databases don't support ``kparams``. Of Django's built-in "
"backends, only Oracle supports it."
msgstr ""
"Glaonn sé nós imeachta stóráilte bunachar sonraí leis an ainm tugtha. "
"Féadfar seicheamh (`params``) nó foclóir (`kparams``) de pharaiméadair "
"ionchuir a sholáthar. Ní thacaíonn an chuid is mó de na bunachair sonraí le "
"``kparams``. De chúltaca ionsuite Django, ní thacaíonn ach Oracle leis."

