msgid "Email backends"
msgstr "Cúltaca ríomhphoist"

msgid "The actual sending of an email is handled by the email backend."
msgstr "Láimhseálann an cúltaca ríomhphoist seoladh iarbhír ríomhphoist."

msgid "The email backend class has the following methods:"
msgstr "Tá na modhanna seo a leanas ag an rang cúltaca ríomhphoist:"

msgid "``open()`` instantiates a long-lived email-sending connection."
msgstr "Cruthaíonn ``open () ``nasc seolta ríomhphoist fadtréimhseolta."

msgid "``close()`` closes the current email-sending connection."
msgstr "Dúnann ``close () ``an nasc seolta ríomhphoist reatha."

msgid ""
"``send_messages(email_messages)`` sends a list "
"of :class:`~django.core.mail.EmailMessage` objects. If the connection is not "
"open, this call will implicitly open the connection, and close the "
"connection afterward. If the connection is already open, it will be left "
"open after mail has been sent."
msgstr ""
"Seolann ``send_messages (email_messages) ``liosta de:class: "
"`~django.core.mail.emailMessage` rudaí. Mura bhfuil an nasc oscailte, "
"osclóidh an glao seo an nasc go hinchinneach, agus dúnfaidh an nasc ina "
"dhiaidh sin. Má tá an nasc oscailte cheana féin, fágfar é ar oscailt tar éis "
"an post a sheoladh."

