msgstr "Sampla de chúltaca ríomhphoist a fháil"

msgid ""
"The :func:`get_connection` function in ``django.core.mail`` returns an "
"instance of the email backend that you can use."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"By default, a call to ``get_connection()`` will return an instance of the "
"email backend specified in :setting:`EMAIL_BACKEND`. If you specify the "
"``backend`` argument, an instance of that backend will be instantiated."
msgstr ""
"De réir réamhshocraithe, cuirfidh glao chuig `get_connection () ``sampla den "
"chúltaca ríomhphoist a shonraítear in:setting: `EMAIL_BACKEND` ar ais. Má "
"shonraíonn tú an argóint ``backend``, cuirfear sampla den chúltaca sin."

msgid ""
"The ``fail_silently`` argument controls how the backend should handle "
"errors. If ``fail_silently`` is True, exceptions during the email sending "
"process will be silently ignored."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn an argóint `fail_silently`` conas ba chóir don chúltaca earráidí a "
"láimhseáil. Má tá `fail_silently`` Fíor, déanfar neamhaird go ciúin ar "
"eisceachtaí le linn an phróisis seolta ríomhphoist."

msgid ""
"All other keyword arguments are passed directly to the constructor of the "
"email backend."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Django ships with several email sending backends. With the exception of the "
"SMTP backend (which is the default), these backends are only useful during "
"testing and development. If you have special email sending requirements, you "
"can :ref:`write your own email backend <topic-custom-email-backend>`."
msgstr ""
"Seolann Django le roinnt cúltaca seolta ríomhphoist. Seachas an cúltaca SMTP "
"(arb é an réamhshocrú), níl na cúltaca seo úsáideach ach le linn tástála "
"agus forbartha. <topic-custom-email-backend>Má tá riachtanais speisialta "
"seolta ríomhphoist agat, is féidir leat: ref: `scríobh do chúltaca "
"ríomhphoist féin `."

