"This static definition is converted at runtime into a widget property named "
"``media``. The list of assets for a ``CalendarWidget`` instance can be "
"retrieved through this property:"
msgstr ""
"Déantar an sainmhíniú statach seo a thiontú ag am rith ina mhaoin giuirléid "
"darb ainm ``meáin ``. Is féidir liosta na sócmhainní do shampla "
"``CalendarWidget`` a aisghabháil tríd an maoin seo:"

