"map closely to Django models. For instance, you might have a ``BlogComment`` "
"model, and you want to create a form that lets people submit comments. In "
"this case, it would be redundant to define the field types in your form, "
"because you've already defined the fields in your model."
msgstr ""
"Má tá aip faoi thiomáint bunachar sonraí á thógáil agat, is dócha go mbeidh "
"foirmeacha agat a léarscálann go dlúth do mhúnlaí Django. Mar shampla, "
"b'fhéidir go mbeadh samhail ``BlogComment ``agat, agus ba mhaith leat foirm "
"a chruthú a ligeann do dhaoine tuairimí a chur isteach. Sa chás seo, bheadh "
"sé iomarcach na cineálacha réimse i d'fhoirm a shainiú, toisc go bhfuil na "
"réimsí i do mhúnla sainmhínithe agat cheana féin."

msgid ""
"For this reason, Django provides a helper class that lets you create a "
"``Form`` class from a Django model."
msgstr ""
