msgid "In addition, each generated form field has attributes set as follows:"
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, tá tréithe socraithe mar seo a leanas ag gach réimse "
"foirme a ghintear"

msgid ""
"If the model field has ``blank=True``, then ``required`` is set to ``False`` "
"on the form field. Otherwise, ``required=True``."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``Blank=True`` sa réimse samhail, ansin socraítear ``riachtan`` go "
"``False`` ar an réimse foirme. Seachas sin, ``Required=True``."

msgid ""
"The form field's ``label`` is set to the ``verbose_name`` of the model "
"field, with the first character capitalized."
msgstr ""
"Socraítear ``lip`` réimse an fhoirme go ``verbose_name`` an réimse samhail, "
"agus an chéad charachtar a chaipitliú."

msgid ""
"The form field's ``help_text`` is set to the ``help_text`` of the model "
"field."
msgstr ""
"Socraítear ``help_text`` réimse an fhoirme go ``help_text`` sa réimse "
"samhail."

msgid ""
"If the model field has ``choices`` set, then the form field's ``widget`` "
"will be set to ``Select``, with choices coming from the model field's "
"``choices``. The choices will normally include the blank choice which is "
"selected by default. If the field is required, this forces the user to make "
"a selection. The blank choice will not be included if the model field has "
"``blank=False`` and an explicit ``default`` value (the ``default`` value "
"will be initially selected instead)."
msgstr ""
"Má tá ``roghanna ``socraithe sa réimse samhail, ansin socraítear "
"``giuirléid`` réimse an fhoirme go ``Roghnaigh ``, agus roghanna a thagann ó "
"`roghanna`` réimse an mhúnla. De ghnáth beidh an rogha bán a roghnaítear de "
"réir réamhshocraithe san áireamh sna roghanna. Má tá an réimse ag teastáil, "
"cuireann sé seo iallach ar an úsáideoir rogha a dhéanamh. Ní chuirfear an "
"rogha bán san áireamh má tá ``blank=false ``sa réimse samhail agus luach "
"sainráite ``default`` (roghnófar an luach ``default`` i dtosach ina ionad)."

msgid ""
"Finally, note that you can override the form field used for a given model "
"field. See `Overriding the default fields`_ below."
msgstr ""
"Faoi dheireadh, tabhair faoi deara gur féidir leat an réimse foirme a "
"úsáidtear do réimse samhail ar leith a shárú. Féach `Sárú ar na réimsí "
"réamhshocraithe `_ thíos."

msgid "Consider this set of models::"
msgstr "Smaoinigh ar an tacar samhlacha seo::"

msgid ""
"With these models, the ``ModelForm`` subclasses above would be roughly "
"equivalent to this (the only difference being the ``save()`` method, which "
"we'll discuss in a moment.)::"
msgstr ""
"Leis na samhlacha seo, bheadh na fo-aicmí `ModelForm ``thuas comhionann go "
"garbh leis seo (is é an t-aon difríocht ná an modh `save () `, a phléifimid "
"i nóiméad. )::"

msgid "Validation on a ``ModelForm``"
msgstr "Bailíochtú ar ``Samhlfhoirme``"

msgid "There are two main steps involved in validating a ``ModelForm``:"
msgstr "Tá dhá phríomhchéim i gceist le “Modelform” a bhailíochtú:"

msgid ":doc:`Validating the form </ref/forms/validation>`"
msgstr ":doc: `An fhoirm a bhailíochtú `</ref/forms/validation>"

msgid ":ref:`Validating the model instance <validating-objects>`"
msgstr "<validating-objects>:ref: `An samhail samhail a bhailíochtú `"

msgid ""
"Just like normal form validation, model form validation is triggered "
"implicitly when calling :meth:`~django.forms.Form.is_valid()` or accessing "
"the :attr:`~django.forms.Form.errors` attribute and explicitly when calling "
"``full_clean()``, although you will typically not use the latter method in "
"practice."
msgstr ""
"Díreach cosúil le gnáthbhailíochtú foirme, spreagtar bailíochtú foirme "
"samhail go hinneach nuair a ghlaoite:meth: `~django.forms.form.is_valid () "
"`nó rochtain ar thréith: attr: `~django.forms.form.errors` agus go sainráite "
"agus tú ag glaoch `full_clean () ``, cé nach n-úsáidfidh tú an dara modh go "
"praiticiúil."

msgid ""
"``Model`` validation (:meth:`Model.full_clean() "
"<django.db.models.Model.full_clean()>`) is triggered from within the form "
"validation step, right after the form's ``clean()`` method is called."
msgstr ""
"Cuirtear bailíochtú ``Model ``(:meth: `Model.full_clean (:) `) a spreagadh ó "
"laisti<django.db.models.Model.full_clean () > gh den chéim bailíochtaithe "
"foirme, díreach tar éis modh ``clean ()`` an fhoirme a ghlaoch."

msgid ""
"The cleaning process modifies the model instance passed to the ``ModelForm`` "
"constructor in various ways. For instance, any date fields on the model are "
"converted into actual date objects. Failed validation may leave the "
"underlying model instance in an inconsistent state and therefore it's not "
"recommended to reuse it."
msgstr ""
"Athraíonn an próiseas glantacháin an tsamhail samhail a chuirtear chuig an "
"tógálaí `ModelForm ``ar bhealaí éagsúla. Mar shampla, déantar aon réimsí "
"dáta ar an tsamhail a thiontú ina rudaí dáta iarbhír. D'fhéadfadh bailíochtú "
"a theip ar an samhail bhunúsach a fhágáil i stát neamhréireach agus dá bhrí "
"sin ní mholtar é a athúsáid."

msgid "Overriding the ``clean()`` method"
msgstr "Sárú ar an modh ``clean () ``"

msgid ""
"You can override the ``clean()`` method on a model form to provide "
"additional validation in the same way you can on a normal form."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat an modh ``clean () ``a shárú ar fhoirm mhúnla chun bailíochtú "
"breise a sholáthar ar an mbealach céanna is féidir leat ar ghnáthfhoirm."

msgid ""
"A model form instance attached to a model object will contain an "
"``instance`` attribute that gives its methods access to that specific model "
"instance."
msgstr ""
"Beidh tréith ``instance`` i gcás foirme samhail atá ceangailte le réad "
"samhail a thugann rochtain dá mhodhanna ar an samhail shonrach sin."

msgid ""
"The ``ModelForm.clean()`` method sets a flag that makes the :ref:`model "
"validation <validating-objects>` step validate the uniqueness of model "
"fields that are marked as ``unique``, ``unique_together`` or "
"``unique_for_date|month|year``."
msgstr ""
"Socraíonn an modh `ModelForm.clean () ``brat <validating-objects>ach a "
"fhágann go ndéanann an chéim:ref: `bailíochtú samhail `uathúlacht réimsí "
"samhail atá marcáilte mar ``unique``, `unique_together`` nó "
"``unique_for_data|mhí|bliain`` a bhailíochtú."

msgid ""
"If you would like to override the ``clean()`` method and maintain this "
"validation, you must call the parent class's ``clean()`` method."
msgstr ""
"Más mian leat an modh ``clean () ``a shárú agus an bailíochtú seo a "
"choinneáil, ní mór duit modh ``clean ()`` an rang tuismitheora a ghlaoch."

msgid "Interaction with model validation"
msgstr "Idirghníomhaíocht le bailíochtú"

msgid ""
"As part of the validation process, ``ModelForm`` will call the ``clean()`` "
"method of each field on your model that has a corresponding field on your "
"form. If you have excluded any model fields, validation will not be run on "
"those fields. See the :doc:`form validation </ref/forms/validation>` "
"documentation for more on how field cleaning and validation work."
msgstr ""
"Mar chuid den phróiseas bailíochtaithe, glaóidh ``ModelForm ``modh `glan "
"()`` gach réimse ar do mhúnla a bhfuil réimse comhfhreagrach aige ar "
"d'fhoirm. Má tá aon réimsí samhlacha eisiata agat, ní reáchtálfar bailíochtú "
"ar na réimsí sin. Féach an doiciméadach:doc: `bailíochtú foirme' le haghaidh "
"tuilleadh eolais fa</ref/forms/validation> oin gcaoi a n-oibríonn glanadh "
"agus bailíochtú"

msgid ""
"The model's ``clean()`` method will be called before any uniqueness checks "
"are made. See :ref:`Validating objects <validating-objects>` for more "
"information on the model's ``clean()`` hook."
msgstr ""
"Glaofar modh ``clean () ``an tsamhail sula ndéantar aon seiceálacha "
"uathúlachta. Féach: tagairt: `Rudaí a bhailíochtú <validating-objects>`le "
"haghaidh tuilleadh faisnéise maidir le crúca ``glan () ``an tsamhail."

msgid "Considerations regarding model's ``error_messages``"
msgstr "Breithnithe maidir le ``error_messages`` an tsamhail"

msgid ""
"Error messages defined at the :attr:`form field "
"<django.forms.Field.error_messages>` level or at the :ref:`form Meta "
"<modelforms-overriding-default-fields>` level always take precedence over "
"the error messages defined at the :attr:`model field "
"<django.db.models.Field.error_messages>` level."
msgstr ""
"<django.db.models.Field.error_messages>Bíonn teachtaireachtaí earráide a "
"shainmhínítear ag leibhéal:attr: `réimse foirme "
"<django.forms.Field.error_messages>`nó ag leibhéal:ref: `form "
"Meta<modelforms-overriding-default-fields>` tosaíocht i gcónaí thar na "
"teachtaireachtaí earráide a shainmhínítear ag leibhéal:attr: `réimse samhail "
"`."

msgid ""
"Error messages  defined on :attr:`model fields "
"<django.db.models.Field.error_messages>` are only used when the "
"``ValidationError`` is raised during the :ref:`model validation <validating-"
"objects>` step and no corresponding error messages are defined at the form "
"level."
msgstr ""
"<validating-objects>Ní úsáidtear teachtaireachtaí earráide a shainmhínítear "
"ar:attr: `réimsí samhail <django.db.models.Field.error_messages>`ach nuair a "
"ardaítear an ``ValidationError`` le linn na céime:ref: `bailíochtú samhail` "
"agus nach sainmhínítear aon teachtaireachtaí earráide comhfhreagracha ag "
"leibhéal na foirme."

msgid ""
"You can override the error messages from ``NON_FIELD_ERRORS`` raised by "
"model validation by adding "
"the :data:`~django.core.exceptions.NON_FIELD_ERRORS` key to the "
"``error_messages`` dictionary of the ``ModelForm``’s inner ``Meta`` class::"
msgstr ""
"Is féidir leat na teachtaireachtaí earráide ó `NON_FIELD_ERRORS`` arna ardú "
"trí bhailíochtú samhail a chur trí:data: "
"`~django.core.exceptions.non_field_errors` eochair leis an bhfoclóir "
"`error_messages`` de rang `Meta`` istigh ``ModelForm``:"

msgid "The ``save()`` method"
msgstr "An modh ``save () ``"

msgid ""
"Every ``ModelForm`` also has a ``save()`` method. This method creates and "
"saves a database object from the data bound to the form. A subclass of "
"``ModelForm`` can accept an existing model instance as the keyword argument "
"``instance``; if this is supplied, ``save()`` will update that instance. If "
"it's not supplied, ``save()`` will create a new instance of the specified "
"model:"
msgstr ""
"Tá modh ``save () ``ag gach `ModelForm`` freisin. Cruthaíonn agus sábhálann "
"an modh seo réad bunachar sonraí ó na sonraí atá ceangailte leis an bhfoirm. "
"Is féidir le fo-aicme de `ModelForm`` glacadh le samhail atá ann cheana mar "
"an argóint eochairfhocal ``instance``; má sholáthraítear é seo, déanfaidh "
"``save () ``an cás sin a nuashonrú. Mura soláthraítear é, cruthóidh ``save "
"() ``sampla nua den tsamhail shonraithe:"

msgid ""
"Note that if the form :ref:`hasn't been validated <validation-on-"
"modelform>`, calling ``save()`` will do so by checking ``form.errors``. A "
"``ValueError`` will be raised if the data in the form doesn't validate -- "
"i.e., if ``form.errors`` evaluates to ``True``."
msgstr ""
"Tabhair faoi deara mura bhfuil an fhoirm:ref: `bailíochtaithe `, déanfar "
"glaoch ar` <validation-on-modelform>save () ``amhlaidh trí ``form.errors`` a "
"sheiceáil. Ardófar ``Error lua`` mura ndéanann na sonraí san fhoirm "
"bailíochtú - ie, má mheasóidh ``form.errors`` go `True``."

msgid ""
"If an optional field doesn't appear in the form's data, the resulting model "
"instance uses the model field :attr:`~django.db.models.Field.default`, if "
"there is one, for that field. This behavior doesn't apply to fields that "
"use :class:`~django.forms.CheckboxInput`, :class:`~django.forms.CheckboxSelectMultiple`, "
"or :class:`~django.forms.SelectMultiple` (or any custom widget "
"whose :meth:`~django.forms.Widget.value_omitted_from_data` method always "
"returns ``False``) since an unchecked checkbox and unselected ``<select "
"multiple>`` don't appear in the data of an HTML form submission. Use a "
"custom form field or widget if you're designing an API and want the default "
"fallback behavior for a field that uses one of these widgets."
msgstr ""
"Mura bhfuil réimse roghnach le feiceáil i sonraí na foirme, úsáideann an "
"samhail mar thoradh air an réimse samhail: attr: "
"`~django.db.models.field.default`, má tá ceann ann, don réimse sin. <select "
"multiple>Ní bhaineann an t-iompar seo le réimsí a úsáide:class: "
"`~django.forms.checkboxInput`, :class: "
"`~django.forms.checkboxSelectMultiple`, no:class: "
"`~django.forms.selectMultiple` (nó aon ghuirléid saincheaptha ciú:meth: "
"`~django.forms.widget.value_omitted_fromdat_dat_dat_Filleann modh ``False`` "
"i gcónaí) ós rud é nach bhfuil bosca seiceála neamhsheiceáilte agus ```` "
"neamhroghnaithe le feiceáil i sonraí aighneachta foirme HTML. Úsáid réimse "
"nó giuirléid fhoirme saincheaptha má tá API á dhearadh agat agus má "
"theastaíonn uait an t-iompar titim réamhshocraithe do réimse a úsáideann "
"ceann de na giuirléidí seo."

msgid ""
"This ``save()`` method accepts an optional ``commit`` keyword argument, "
"which accepts either ``True`` or ``False``. If you call ``save()`` with "
"``commit=False``, then it will return an object that hasn't yet been saved "
"to the database. In this case, it's up to you to call ``save()`` on the "
"resulting model instance. This is useful if you want to do custom processing "
"on the object before saving it, or if you want to use one of the "
"specialized :ref:`model saving options <ref-models-force-insert>`. "
"``commit`` is ``True`` by default."
msgstr ""
"Glacann an modh ``save () ``seo le hargóint eochairfhocal roghnach "
"``commit``, a ghlacann le ``True`` nó ``False``. Má ghlaonn tú ar ``save () "
"``le `Commit=false``, ansin cuirfidh sé rud ar ais nár shábháiltear go fóill "
"chuig an mbunachar sonraí. Sa chás seo, is fútsa atá sé glaoch ar ``save () "
"``ar an gcás samhail mar thoradh air. <ref-models-force-insert>Tá sé seo "
"úsáideach más mian leat próiseáil saincheaptha a dhéanamh ar an réad sula "
"ndéanann tú é a shábháil, nó más mian leat ceann de na roghanna "
"speisialaithe: ref: `samhail sábhála `a úsáid. Is é ``commit`` ``True`` de "
"réir réamhshocraithe."

msgid ""
"Another side effect of using ``commit=False`` is seen when your model has a "
"many-to-many relation with another model. If your model has a many-to-many "
"relation and you specify ``commit=False`` when you save a form, Django "
"cannot immediately save the form data for the many-to-many relation. This is "
"because it isn't possible to save many-to-many data for an instance until "
"the instance exists in the database."
msgstr ""
"Feictear fo-éifeacht eile a bhaineann le `Commit=false ``a úsáid nuair a "
"bhíonn gaol go leor ag do mhúnla le samhail eile. Má tá gaol go leor ag do "
"mhúnla agus má shonraíonn tú ``Commit=false ``nuair a shábhálann tú foirm, "
"ní féidir le Django sonraí na foirme a shábháil láithreach don ghaol go "
"leor. Tá sé seo toisc nach féidir sonraí go leor a shábháil mar shampla go "
"dtí go mbeidh an cás sa bhunachar sonraí."

msgid ""
"To work around this problem, every time you save a form using "
"``commit=False``, Django adds a ``save_m2m()`` method to your ``ModelForm`` "
"subclass. After you've manually saved the instance produced by the form, you "
"can invoke ``save_m2m()`` to save the many-to-many form data. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Chun oibriú timpeall ar an bhfadhb seo, gach uair a shábhálann tú foirm ag "
"baint úsáide as `Commit=false``, cuireann Django modh ``save_m2m () ``le do "
"fho-aicme ``ModelForm``. Tar éis duit an cás a tháirgeann an fhoirm a "
"shábháil de láimh, is féidir leat `save_m2m () ``a ghairm chun na sonraí "
"foirme go leor a shábháil. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Calling ``save_m2m()`` is only required if you use ``save(commit=False)``. "
"When you use a ``save()`` on a form, all data -- including many-to-many data "
"-- is saved without the need for any additional method calls.  For example:"
msgstr ""
"Ní gá glaoch ar `save_m2m () ``ach má úsáideann tú ``save (Commit=false)``. "
"Nuair a úsáideann tú ``save () ``ar fhoirm, sábhálfar na sonraí go léir - "
"lena n-áirítear go leor sonraí - gan aon ghlaonna modh breise a bheith ag "
"teastáil. Mar shampla:"

msgid ""
"Other than the ``save()`` and ``save_m2m()`` methods, a ``ModelForm`` works "
"exactly the same way as any other ``forms`` form. For example, the "
"``is_valid()`` method is used to check for validity, the ``is_multipart()`` "
"method is used to determine whether a form requires multipart file upload "
"(and hence whether ``request.FILES`` must be passed to the form), etc. "
"See :ref:`binding-uploaded-files` for more information."
msgstr ""
"Seachas na modhanna `save () ``agus `save_m2m ()``, oibríonn ``Modelform`` "
"díreach ar an mbealach céanna le haon fhoirm ``foirme`` eile. Mar shampla, "
"úsáidtear an modh ``is_valid () ``chun bailíocht a sheiceáil, úsáidtear an "
"modh ``is_multipart ()`` chun a chinneadh an gá uaslódáil comhad "
"ilpháirteach ó fhoirm (agus dá bhrí sin an gcaithfear ``request.files`` a "
"chur chuig an bhfoirm), srl. Féach: `binding-uploaded-files` le haghaidh "
"tuilleadh faisnéise."

msgid "Selecting the fields to use"
msgstr "Roghnú na réimsí le húsáid"

msgid ""
"It is strongly recommended that you explicitly set all fields that should be "
"edited in the form using the ``fields`` attribute. Failure to do so can "
"easily lead to security problems when a form unexpectedly allows a user to "
"set certain fields, especially when new fields are added to a model. "
"Depending on how the form is rendered, the problem may not even be visible "
"on the web page."
msgstr ""
"Moltar go láidir duit gach réimse a shocrú go sainráite ar chóir a chur in "
"eagar sa fhoirm ag baint úsáide as an tréith ``fields``. D'fhéadfadh "
"fadhbanna slándála a bheith mar thoradh air go héasca nuair a cheadaíonn "
"foirm gan choinne d'úsáideoir réimsí áirithe a shocrú, go háirithe nuair a "
"chuirtear réimsí nua le samhail. Ag brath ar an gcaoi a ndéantar an fhoirm a "
"léiriú, b'fhéidir nach mbeadh an fhadhb le feiceáil fiú ar an leathanach"

msgid ""
"The alternative approach would be to include all fields automatically, or "
"remove only some. This fundamental approach is known to be much less secure "
"and has led to serious exploits on major websites (e.g. `GitHub <https://"
"github.blog/2012-03-04-public-key-security-vulnerability-and-mitigation/>`_)."
msgstr ""
"Ba é an cur chuige malartach ná gach réimse a áireamh go huathoibríoch, nó "
"ach cuid acu a bhaint. Is eol go bhfuil an cur chuige bunúsach seo i bhfad "
"níos lú slán agus mar thoradh ar leasúcháin tromchúiseacha air ar láithreáin "
"ghréasáin móra (m.sh. `Github`_ < https://github.blog/2012-03-04-public-key-"
"security-vulnerability-and-mitigation/>)."

msgid ""
"There are, however, two shortcuts available for cases where you can "
"guarantee these security concerns do not apply to you:"
msgstr ""
"Tá dhá aicearra ar fáil, áfach, do chásanna inar féidir leat a ráthú nach "
"mbaineann na hábhair imní slándála seo leat:"

msgid ""
"Set the ``fields`` attribute to the special value ``'__all__'`` to indicate "
"that all fields in the model should be used. For example::"
msgstr ""
"Socraigh an tréith ``fields`` don luach speisialta ```__all__'`` chun a "
"léiriú gur chóir gach réimse sa tsamhail a úsáid. Mar shampla::"

msgid ""
"Set the ``exclude`` attribute of the ``ModelForm``’s inner ``Meta`` class to "
"a list of fields to be excluded from the form."
msgstr ""
"Socraigh tréith ``eisiam`` d'aicme ``Meta`` istigh an `ModelForm`` chuig "
"liosta réimsí atá le eisiamh ón bhfoirm."

msgid ""
"Since the ``Author`` model has the 3 fields ``name``, ``title`` and "
"``birth_date``, this will result in the fields ``name`` and ``birth_date`` "
"being present on the form."
msgstr ""
"Ós rud é go bhfuil na 3 réimse ``ainm``, `teideal ``agus ``dáta_bhreith`` sa "
"tsamhail ``Údar``, beidh na réimsí ``ainm`` agus `dáta_bhreith`` i láthair "
"ar an bhfoirm."

msgid ""
"If either of these are used, the order the fields appear in the form will be "
"the order the fields are defined in the model, with ``ManyToManyField`` "
"instances appearing last."
msgstr ""
"Má úsáidtear ceachtar díobh seo, is é an t-ord a bheidh na réimsí le "
"feiceáil san fhoirm an t-ord a shainmhínítear na réimsí sa tsamhail, agus "
"cásanna ``ManyTomanyField` le feiceáil go deireanach."

msgid ""
"In addition, Django applies the following rule: if you set "
"``editable=False`` on the model field, *any* form created from the model via "
"``ModelForm`` will not include that field."
msgstr ""
"Ina theannta sin, cuireann Django an riail seo a leanas i bhfeidhm: má "
"shocraíonn tú ``Editable=False`` ar an réimse samhail, ní chuimseoidh an "
"réimse sin *aon fhoirme* a cruthaíodh ón tsamhail trí `ModelForm ``."

msgid ""
"Any fields not included in a form by the above logic will not be set by the "
"form's ``save()`` method. Also, if you manually add the excluded fields back "
"to the form, they will not be initialized from the model instance."
msgstr ""
"Ní shocrófar aon réimsí nach bhfuil san áireamh i bhfoirm de réir an loighic "
"thuas trí mhodh `save () ``na foirme. Chomh maith leis sin, má chuireann tú "
"na réimsí eisiata ar ais leis an bhfoirm de láimh, ní thionscnófar iad ón "
"gcás samhail."

msgid ""
"Django will prevent any attempt to save an incomplete model, so if the model "
"does not allow the missing fields to be empty, and does not provide a "
"default value for the missing fields, any attempt to ``save()`` a "
"``ModelForm`` with missing fields will fail.  To avoid this failure, you "
"must instantiate your model with initial values for the missing, but "
"required fields::"
msgstr ""
"Cuirfidh Django cosc ar aon iarracht samhail neamhiomlán a shábháil, mar sin "
"mura gceadaíonn an tsamhail do na réimsí atá in easnamh a bheith folamh, "
"agus mura soláthraíonn sé luach réamhshocraithe do na réimsí atá in easnamh, "
"teipeann ar aon iarracht ```ModelForm ``le réimsí in easnamh. Chun an teip "
"seo a sheachaint, ní mór duit do mhúnla a thabhairt le luachanna tosaigh do "
"na réimsí atá in easnamh ach riachtanacha:"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use ``save(commit=False)`` and manually set any extra "
"required fields::"
msgstr ""
"De rogha air sin, is féidir leat `save (Commit=False) ``a úsáid agus aon "
"réimsí breise riachtanacha a shocrú de láimh:"

msgid ""
"See the `section on saving forms`_ for more details on using "
"``save(commit=False)``."
msgstr ""
"Féach an `alt ar fhoirmeacha sábhála`_ le haghaidh tuilleadh sonraí maidir "
"le ``save (Commit=False) ``a úsáid."

msgid "Overriding the default fields"
msgstr "Sárú ar na réimsí réamhshocraithe"

msgid ""
"The default field types, as described in the `Field types`_ table above, are "
"sensible defaults. If you have a ``DateField`` in your model, chances are "
"you'd want that to be represented as a ``DateField`` in your form. But "
"``ModelForm`` gives you the flexibility of changing the form field for a "
"given model."
msgstr ""
"Is réamhshocruithe ciallmhar iad na cineálacha réimse réamhshocraithe, mar a "
"thuairiscítear sa tábla `Cineálacha réimse `_ thuas. Má tá ``Datefield`` "
"agat i do mhúnla, is dócha gur mhaith leat é sin a léiriú mar ``Datefield`` "
"i do fhoirm. Ach tugann ``ModelForm ``an solúbthacht duit an réimse foirme a "
"athrú do mhúnla ar leith."

msgid ""
"To specify a custom widget for a field, use the ``widgets`` attribute of the "
"inner ``Meta`` class. This should be a dictionary mapping field names to "
"widget classes or instances."
msgstr ""
"Chun giuirléid saincheaptha do réimse a shonrú, bain úsáid as an tréith "
"``giuirléidí ``den aicme ``Meta`` istigh. Ba chóir go mbeadh sé seo ina "
"fhoclóir a mhapáil ainmneacha réimse chuig ranganna nó cásanna"

msgid ""
