"Tabhair faoi deara gur chóir go mbeadh modhanna iarratais i uachchláracha"

msgid "Decorator to require that a view only accepts the GET method."
msgstr "Maisitheoir a cheangal nach nglacann radharc ach leis an modh GET."

msgid "Decorator to require that a view only accepts the POST method."
msgstr "Maisitheoir a cheangal nach nglacann radharc ach leis an modh POST."

