"Decorator to require that a view only accepts the GET and HEAD methods. "
"These methods are commonly considered \"safe\" because they should not have "
"the significance of taking an action other than retrieving the requested "
"resource."
msgstr ""
"Maisitheoir a cheangal nach nglacann dearcadh ach leis na modhanna GET agus "
"HEAD. Meastar go coitianta na modhanna seo “sábháilte” toisc nár cheart go "
"mbeadh an tábhacht acu gníomh a dhéanamh seachas an acmhainn iarrtha a "
"aisghabháil."

msgid ""
"Web servers should automatically strip the content of responses to HEAD "
"requests while leaving the headers unchanged, so you may handle HEAD "
"requests exactly like GET requests in your views. Since some software, such "
"as link checkers, rely on HEAD requests, you might prefer using "
"``require_safe`` instead of ``require_GET``."
msgstr ""
"Ba chóir do fhreastalaithe gréasáin ábhar na bhfreagraí ar iarratais HEAD a "
"scriosadh go huathoibríoch agus na ceanntásc a fhágáil gan athrú, ionas gur "
"féidir leat iarratais HEAD a láimhseáil Ós rud é go bhfuil roinnt bogearraí, "
"mar shampla seiceálaithe nasc, ag brath ar iarratais HEAD, b'fhéidir gur "
"fearr leat ``requi_safe`` a úsáid in ionad ``Require_Get``."

