msgstr "Comhbhrú GZip"

msgid ""
"The decorators in :mod:`django.views.decorators.gzip` control content "
"compression on a per-view basis."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn na maisitheoirí in:mod: `django.views.decorators.gzip` comhbhrú "
"ábhair ar bhonn aghaidh amharc."

msgid ""
"This decorator compresses content if the browser allows gzip compression. It "
"sets the ``Vary`` header accordingly, so that caches will base their storage "
"on the ``Accept-Encoding`` header."
msgstr ""
"Comhbhrúiteann an maisitheoir seo ábhar má cheadaíonn an brabhsálaí comhbhrú "
"g Socraíonn sé an ceanntásc ``Vary`` dá réir sin, ionas go mbunóidh caches a "
"gcuid stórála ar an gceannteideal ``Accept-Encoding``."

