msgstr "Ceanntásca athraithe"

msgid ""
"The decorators in :mod:`django.views.decorators.vary` can be used to control "
"caching based on specific request headers."
msgstr ""
"Is féidir na maisitheoirí in:mod: `django.views.decorators.vary` a úsáid "
"chun caistriú a rialú bunaithe ar cheannteidil iarratais ar leith."

msgid ""
"The ``Vary`` header defines which request headers a cache mechanism should "
"take into account when building its cache key."
msgstr ""
"Sainmhíníonn an ceannteideal `Vary` cén ceannteideal iarratais ba chóir do "
"mheicníocht taisce a chur san áireamh agus a eochair taisce á thógáil."

msgid "See :ref:`using vary headers <using-vary-headers>`."
msgstr ""
"<using-vary-headers>Féach: ref: `ag baint úsáide as ceannteidil éagsúla `."

msgid "Caching"
msgstr "Cacháil"

msgid ""
"The decorators in :mod:`django.views.decorators.cache` control server and "
"client-side caching."
msgstr ""
"Rialaíonn na maisitheoirí in:mod: `django.views.decorators.cache` freastalaí "
"agus taiscáil taobh an chliaint."

msgid ""
