"éasca ag baint úsáide as a:class: `~django.forms.ModelForm`. Sábhálfar réad "
"an chomhaid chuig an suíomh a shonraítear leis an:attr: "
"`~django.db.models.filefield.upload_to` argóint an chomhfhreagraí:class: "
"`~django.db.models.filefield` nuair a ghlaoch ``form.save () ``:"

msgid ""
"If you are constructing an object manually, you can assign the file object "
"from :attr:`request.FILES <django.http.HttpRequest.FILES>` to the file field "
